  "description": "In an era of living long with illness, what if you had the chance to live your last month healthily? There exists a unique insurance in the world that guarantees healthy time to terminal patients! A vivid report on fulfilling customer wishes by insurance king Lee Yeon-hong, who dreams of quitting the insurance company that takes responsibility for customers’ last wishes, and curious Gen-Z newcomer Kim Seon-yu.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3000015463), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67787913), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000073245), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13206571), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/ilovetimedesu), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/saranghamnida_gogaeknim)",
